# start Validation Reply Form
_vrf_THETM01_try                 
;
PROBLEM: The value of sine(theta_max)/wavelength is less than 0.550
RESPONSE: A full data set was collected (2Theta:41.886), but the high 
angle data was dominated by noise [I/sigma(I)<1.5] and was removed.
The large structure size coupled with disorder within the structure have
led to this alert. Regardless, a high completion factor (99.5%) and low
R1 value (4.95%) were attained.
;
_vrf_PLAT220_try                 
;
PROBLEM: NonSolvent   Resd 1  O   Ueq(max)/Ueq(min) Range        8.5 Ratio 
RESPONSE: This alert was generated by the large amount of disorder within
the structure.
;
_vrf_PLAT241_try                 
;
PROBLEM: High   'MainMol' Ueq as Compared to Neighbors of        S40 Check 
RESPONSE: This alert was generated by the large amount of disorder within
the structure. Specifically, interaction between the solvent molecules and
the barrier sulfur atoms is highly disordered.
;
_vrf_PLAT306_try                 
;
PROBLEM: Isolated Oxygen Atom (H-atoms Missing ?) .......       O07C Check 
RESPONSE: This alert refers to solvent water oxygen atoms. The hydrogen 
atoms were not modeled.
;
_vrf_PLAT975_try                 
;
PROBLEM: Check Calcd Resid. Dens.  0.76A   From O08Q            1.67 eA-3  
RESPONSE: This alert was generated by the large amount of disorder within
the structure.
;
